# Web Publish (Permanent)

## Law

**Approval `published` ≠ public web profile.**

| Concern | Mechanism |
| --- | --- |
| Approval workflow | `documents.status` (`draft`→`review`→`approved`→`published`) — ADR 021 |
| **Web Publish** | `web_published` + `web_slug` on `documents` — public HTML profile |

Do not overload workflow `POST .../workflow/publish` for public URLs.

## Source of truth

Public HTML and PDF share **`DocumentHtmlRenderer`** (via `ExportService.buildDocumentHtml`):

- Same Mongo body + design theme tokens + bindings / modules / visibility
- `lang` / `dir` from document content locale (ADR 015)
- White-label chrome (logo, display name, Powered-by) from `business_branding` — never a second brand store

## Gates

- Enable / update slug / take offline: `EntitlementGuard` + writable + `@RequirePermission(documents.publish)`
- `web_published=true` only when `status ∈ {approved, published}` (same bar as final PDF)
- Leaving approved/published (workflow unpublish / reopen / reject) **must** clear `web_published`

## Public routes

- Member: `GET|PATCH /api/businesses/:businessId/documents/:documentId/web-publish`
- Public: `GET /api/public/documents/:businessId/:slug` → HTML + meta (no JWT)
- Optional host: `GET /api/public/documents/by-host?host=&slug=` via branding `custom_domain`
- Public logo: `GET /api/public/branding/:businessId/logo` (no JWT; bytes only if logo exists)

Web UI: `/[locale]/p/[businessId]/[slug]` with basic SEO metadata.

## Slug

- Lowercase `[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*`, length 3–64
- Unique per `businessId` (`@@unique([businessId, webSlug])`)
